# The big screen: offered on a pad's first press on Home, stayed away from,
# and not offered again; F11 on and off; Settings' Launcher page's Always,
# Never and Always again, kept: test_ui_scripts.c reads launcher.ini after.
wait 2
expect home
big off
pad attach xbox
wait 2
pad button 12 down
pad button 12 up
wait 0.5
expect confirm
find Stay as it is
key Return
wait 0.5
expect home
big off
pad button 12 down
pad button 12 up
wait 0.5
expect home
key F11
wait 0.5
big on
key F11
wait 0.5
big off
find Settings
key Return
wait 0.5
expect settings
find Launcher
key Return
wait 0.3
expect settings Launcher
find Big screen
key Right
wait 0.5
big on
key Right
wait 0.5
big off
key Left
wait 0.5
big on
find Done
key Return
wait 0.5
expect home
big on
find Quit
key Return
